{"step_index":176,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:15:13Z","content":"The fullstack boutique platform for **Cake N Flowers — Atelier Floral & Pâtisserie** has been built, seeded, and verified!\n\nThe project is located at:\n`C:\\Users\\karth\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\cake-n-flowers` *(we recommend setting this folder as your active workspace)*.\n\nPlease review the complete [Walkthrough Documentation](file:///C:/Users/karth/.gemini/antigravity/brain/17879b4e-209a-4bbf-8e38-6cec75327a3e/walkthrough.md) for full architecture details, test results, and feature highlights.\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 What Was Built\n\n1. **Editorial Boutique Design System**:\n   - Palette of warm cream, deep forest sage, rose blush, and champagne gold.\n   - Elegant typography pairing (`Playfair Display` & `Cormorant Garamond` headers with `Plus Jakarta Sans` body).\n   - Glassmorphism overlays, subtle zoom reveals, and micro-interactions.\n\n2. **Interactive Bespoke Customizer**:\n   - Portion / weight selector (500g, 1kg, 2kg, etc.) and stem tier selector.\n   - Artisan flavor fillings (Belgian 70% Dark Truffle, French Vanilla Bean, Red Velvet Rose, Salted Caramel, Pistachio).\n   - 100% Eggless preparation toggle.\n   - Cake icing text inscription (e.g. *\"Happy 30th Birthday Victoria!\"*).\n   - Free handwritten botanical message card composer.\n   - Custom photo cake uploader for edible sugar prints.\n\n3. **Scheduled White-Glove Delivery**:\n   - Morning, Standard Afternoon, Evening, and Midnight Surprise (11:00 PM – 12:00 AM) delivery slots.\n   - Pincode delivery checking and same-day cutoff validation.\n\n4. **Real-Time Visual Order Tracker**:\n   - 5-stage interactive progress tracker: *Confirmed → Artisan Kitchen Preparation → Quality Inspected → Out for Delivery (with temperature-controlled van details) → Delivered*.\n\n5. **Operations Admin Portal**:\n   - Real-time revenue & sales KPI metrics.\n   - Order management with immediate status updating (which updates client tracking in real-time).\n   - Product catalog editor & promotional coupon generator.\n\n6. **Database & API Ready**:\n   - Pre-seeded SQLite database for zero-dependency immediate local development.\n   - Production PostgreSQL schema (`schema.postgres.prisma`) ready for Neon, Supabase, Railway, or Render.\n   - Stripe card payment integration with sandbox simulation fallback.\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Verification Summary\n\n- **Backend Automated Tests**: Passed with exit code `0` (Health check, categories, products, coupon calculation, order tracking).\n- **Frontend Production Build**: Vite compiled `1600 modules` cleanly into optimized static assets in `6.42s`.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 How to Run the App\n\nOpen two terminal windows in `C:\\Users\\karth\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\cake-n-flowers`:\n\n```bash\n# Terminal 1: Backend API\ncd backend\nnpm start\n# Running on http://localhost:5000\n\n# Terminal 2: Frontend Storefront\ncd frontend\nnpm run dev\n# Running on http://localhost:5173\n```\n\n#### Pre-seeded Demo Credentials & References:\n- **Admin**: `admin@cakenflowers.com` / `AdminPassword123!`\n- **Customer**: `olivia@example.com` / `Customer123!` *(one-click demo autofill buttons available in the sign-in modal)*\n- **Live Tracking Order Number**: **`CNF-2026-8941`**\n- **Promotional Coupons**: `WELCOME10` (10% off), `LUXURY20` (20% off), `SWEET5` ($5 off)"}
