{"step_index":202,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:24:21Z","thinking":"**Designing Multi-Photo Gallery Manager**\n\nDeveloping the multi-photo gallery manager requires careful planning. First, implement a file upload input to enable selecting multiple image files simultaneously, enhancing user experience with the \"Upload from Computer\" feature. This feature requires including a loading spinner feedback during uploads.\n\nIn addition, consider a web URL adder, enabling image imports from various online sources. A thumbnail gallery will provide visual previews of all uploaded photos within the manager.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Add multi-photo uploader and gallery manager to AdminDashboard\"","EndLine":"520","Instruction":"\"Replace single image input with multi-photo upload and URL adder with thumbnail gallery\"","ReplacementContent":"\"              {/* Multi-Photo Manager */}\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-2 p-3.5 bg-boutique-paper/60 rounded-2xl border border-boutique-border\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"block text-[11px] font-semibold text-boutique-charcoal\\\">\\n                    Product Photography ({newProdImages.length} photos)\\n                  </label>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-boutique-gold font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                    First photo is Cover\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Upload Multiple Files Button */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex gap-2 items-center\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"cursor-pointer bg-white hover:bg-boutique-cream text-boutique-forest border border-boutique-border px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5 transition shadow-xs\\\">\\n          