{"step_index":206,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-06T08:24:50Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with multi-photo upload documentation\"","EndLine":"60","Instruction":"\"Document multi-photo upload capabilities in walkthrough.md\"","ReplacementContent":"\"5. **Operations Admin Portal & Multi-Photo Manager**:\\n   - Real-time revenue & sales KPI metrics.\\n   - **Multi-Photo Product Photography**:\\n     - Bulk upload multiple photos directly from device (up to 10 files simultaneously).\\n     - Paste external image URLs (Cloudinary, AWS S3, Unsplash).\\n     - Visual thumbnail grid with \\\"Cover Photo\\\" designation, \\\"Make Cover\\\" reordering, and individual removal.\\n   - Immediate order status dropdown updates that reflect on customer tracking screens in real-time.\\n   - Product catalog editor & promotional coupon generator.\"","StartLine":"50","TargetContent":"\"5. **Operations Admin Portal**:\\n   - Live revenue & order KPIs.\\n   - Immediate order status dropdown updates that reflect on customer tracking screens in real-time.\\n   - Product catalog editor & promotional coupon generator.\"","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\karth\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\17879b4e-209a-4bbf-8e38-6cec75327a3e\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md\""}}]}
